{
 "Anima Artist Scheduled Mixer": "Anima 画师串调度混合",
 "Independent artist encoding and scheduled cross-attention mixing for Anima.\nEach artist row is encoded separately as `artist + base prompt`, then mixed inside Anima cross-attention. The default `Output average + Interpolate` path follows the stronger reference behavior from [https://github.com/An1X3R/Anima-Artist-Mixer](https://github.com/An1X3R/Anima-Artist-Mixer); `Quality-safe delta` is still available when you want a more conservative Forge-friendly blend.\n\nTemplates keep stable internal values, so templates saved with English, Chinese, or raw option values all load.\n\nThanks to **An1X3R/Anima-Artist-Mixer** and **汐浮尘/utowo** for the original split-and-encode/cross-attention design.": "面向 Anima 的独立画师编码与按阶段 cross-attention 混合。每个画师会单独按 `画师 + 主提示词` 编码，再在 Anima 的 cross-attention 内混合。默认的“输出平均 + 插值融合”沿用 [https://github.com/An1X3R/Anima-Artist-Mixer](https://github.com/An1X3R/Anima-Artist-Mixer) 的强混合路线；需要更保守的 Forge 友好混合时，也可以手动切到“保真增量”。\n\n模板内部使用稳定值保存，旧模板即使保存过英文、中文或原始值，也能正确加载。\n\n感谢 **An1X3R/Anima-Artist-Mixer** 与 **汐浮尘/utowo** 的原始独立编码和 cross-attention 混合设计。",
 "Compatibility: Artist Mixer, FreeFuse, and Regional Conditioning are one-of-three; the active choice locks the others.": "兼容性：画师串混合、FreeFuse 与区域条件三选一；启用其中一个会锁定其他两个。",
